HiRE - High-resolution energy model for RNA

This model is under development, and we hope to complete this development by early 2024. 
If you want to use it in the meantime, please contact Konstantin Roeder (konstantin.roeder_at_kcl.ac.uk) or Samuela Pasquali (samuela.pasquali_at_u-paris.fr) 
for advice on how to use it, and what to look out for.

To compile the code run:

- createHIREexec for stand-alone HiRE version
- createMDexec for HiRE MD executable
- createGMINexec for HiRE GMIN executable

See Examples for some basic examples and guidance on use.
The examples have been updated on 10/10/2023 and are workign for the 80 parameter version of HiRE.
The parameter set and example ar enot necessarily optimised simulations, but are simply illustrations of how to use the software.

